#33101
A Bay~
You are in a large bay, busy with shipping.  All around you, the sounds of
ships and sailors at work echo across the bay as ships sail into and out of
the harbor, and cargos are loaded and unloaded.  Stretching up a gentle
hill north of the bay lies a town and a large castle.  Atop the castle,
penants snap in a light breeze.
~
