#33102
A Dock~
You are on a busy dock servicing a large bay.  Around you, longshoremen rush
to load and unload ships, and passengers wait to board.  Along the dock
stacks of crates and sacks of produce sit to be moved, and seagulls fight
for scraps of food.  To the north the dock leads into a town, where you can
see citizenry going about their business.  A &10sign&00 marking the end of the docks
catches your eye.
~
