sign~
The sign reads:
  Welcome to Abenos!

This city is founded on peace and trade, and as such all visitors are
required to keep their weapons sheathed and their fists to themselves.  All
city patrols are instructed to enforce this, so please ensure you adhere
to our simple rules.
~
