#33111
The Dockmaster's Office~
The Dockmaster's office is a very important part of Abenos.  Here is where
the dockmaster plans and organises, designs and schedules, and keeps goods
and passengers flowing into and out of Abenos.  The room itself is plainly
furnished, with a few chairs for waiting captains, a single painting on the
west wall, and a large, worn desk where the dockmaster works.
~
