Potions and More~
You are in a typical apothecary.  Unidentified smells compete for the title
of Strangest Odor, and various bubbling, squeaking and popping sounds come
from the jars lining the shelves that cover every wall.  The jars are 
arranged by contents, with small neat lables on the shelves identifying the
contents.  A browned gnome with a receding hairline and missing eyebrows
carefully adds a few drops of some liquid to a pale yellow potion in a
beaker, a slightly fearful expression on his face.
