The East Gate~
You are at the east gate of Abenos.  To the west, Market Road leads towards
the center of the city, and to the east the gates mark the edge of town.
The walls of Abenos stand slightly above head height, around 8 foot high,
and the gates are a little taller again.  Made of wrought iron, they are
