#33165
A Jail Cell~
You are in the only jail cell the city of Abenos has.  The crime rate here
is low enough that this cell sees little use.  People convicted here of
serious offenses are shipped off to Denegorth to serve out their time, or
in some rare cases sent up to the castle.  The only thing of note is a
scratching on the wall where someone has marked off 7 days.
