A Guard House~
You are in the main Abenos guard house.  This is where guards report at the
start and end of their shifts, and where offduty guards can kick back and
relax.  There is a large desk to the north of the room, and a number of
tables with chairs towards the south.  Several fresh loaves of bread stand
on the table closest to the fire, over which a pig carcass roasts slowly.
The only exit is west, onto Fenton Street.
