#33197
Outside a snow covered house~
You are standing in the garden of a small brick house.  Around you, snow
covers everything.  You can see the heads of some garden gnomes peeking out
in places, and here and there a snowman is standing with a large smile made
from small pebbles.  Around the garden is a barely visible white picket
fence.  To your north, a door lies open, spilling warmth and light out onto
the garden.
