#33198
A Cheery House~
You are standing in a brightly lit and colourfully decorated house.  To your
south, the front door opens onto a snow covered garden.  As you look around
the room, you notice that nearly every available surface has some sort of
decoration on it, from red and green socks hanging off the mantlepiece to
streamers and garlands of flowers swinging from the ceiling.  A large fire
in the hearth provides more than enough heat for the room, making a sharp
contrast from the weather outside.
